{"start": 0.02, "end": 2.78, "text": "Instead of being teammates through the grind of life,", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 2.78, "end": 4.86, "text": "as Ecclesiastes 9-9 calls us to,", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 4.86, "end": 6.78, "text": "we took each other for granted", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 6.78, "end": 9.02, "text": "and we turned each other into opponents.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 9.02, "end": 11.26, "text": "And now we saw everything we said and did in one,", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 11.26, "end": 13.56, "text": "it was all just, and everything.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 13.56, "end": 14.82, "text": "We could be, hey, where do you want to eat?", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 14.82, "end": 17.22, "text": "I don't care.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 17.22, "end": 18.26, "text": "Why don't we try red lobster?", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 18.26, "end": 20.55, "text": "I'm not feeling seafood.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 20.55, "end": 22.11, "text": "What about olive, you're not feeling, okay,", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 22.11, "end": 22.95, "text": "you just said you don't care,", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 22.95, "end": 36.04, "text": "but you have a strong opinion on where we eat.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 36.04, "end": 37.92, "text": "Well, I traveled here alone tonight.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 37.92, "end": 38.92, "text": "I'm from Branson, Missouri.", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 38.92, "end": 41.36, "text": "Anybody been to Branson, Missouri?", "avg_logprob": -0.1842, "no_speech_prob": 0.141, "compression_ratio": 1.7372}
{"start": 41.36, "end": 42.97, "text": "Woo!", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 42.97, "end": 48.53, "text": "I usually am told my parents love that place, and so bring your parents to Branson.", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 48.53, "end": 53.37, "text": "We would love to entertain them on Country Music Boulevard, but my name is Ted Cunningham.", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 53.37, "end": 58.73, "text": "I pastor a church, Woodland Hills Family Church in Branson, and grateful to be here tonight", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 58.73, "end": 59.81, "text": "to be a part of it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 59.81, "end": 62.45, "text": "I met my wife Amy on a blind date.", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 62.45, "end": 63.45, "text": "I'll show you a picture of her.", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 63.45, "end": 68.73, "text": "I met her on a blind date at Liberty University over 23 years ago, and the night I met her", "avg_logprob": -0.1318, "no_speech_prob": 0.0288, "compression_ratio": 1.6209}
{"start": 68.73, "end": 72.51, "text": "I looked at my friend, I said, I'm going to marry this woman.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 72.51, "end": 74.27, "text": "And Austin said, you can't decide that.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 74.27, "end": 75.35, "text": "I said, I already did.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 75.35, "end": 78.12, "text": "I just decided that.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 78.12, "end": 84.08, "text": "And I'll never forget walking into the kitchen of her six-foot-two full-blooded Norwegian", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 84.08, "end": 85.37, "text": "father.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 85.37, "end": 89.47, "text": "And I said, I would like permission to marry your daughter, to which he responded in his", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 89.47, "end": 95.05, "text": "thick Norwegian accent, you'll betcha.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 95.05, "end": 97.33, "text": "I said, but only under one condition.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 97.33, "end": 98.67, "text": "I had just graduated.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 98.67, "end": 99.67, "text": "She had a year left.", "avg_logprob": -0.1601, "no_speech_prob": 0.0131, "compression_ratio": 1.6741}
{"start": 99.67, "end": 104.27, "text": "And I'm an advocate for young marriage and so I wanted to break all the rules and have", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 104.27, "end": 108.31, "text": "us get married at 22 and 21, but I wanted to get married between her junior and her", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 108.31, "end": 109.31, "text": "senior year.", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 109.31, "end": 115.07, "text": "And I said, I'll only do it in between her junior and senior year if you let me pay for", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 115.07, "end": 117.83, "text": "her senior year of college.", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 117.83, "end": 125.12, "text": "To which he said, you betcha.", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 125.12, "end": 129.02, "text": "And I'm telling you, you haven't, listen, marriage, it's been so much, I'm going to", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 129.02, "end": 132.44, "text": "have young guys come up to me all the time and they're like, bro, how did you get married", "avg_logprob": -0.1395, "no_speech_prob": 0.0093, "compression_ratio": 1.8425}
{"start": 132.44, "end": 136.8, "text": "at 22 and 21 and pay cash for a senior year of college, I said, it's this thing called", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 136.8, "end": 137.8, "text": "a job.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 137.8, "end": 140.15, "text": "I had a job.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 140.15, "end": 142.43, "text": "And they, I always get pushback from young guys.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 142.43, "end": 145.59, "text": "They'll be like, bro, I can't afford to get married that young.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 145.59, "end": 149.55, "text": "And I'm always like, bro, I would believe that if you weren't holding a Venti Caramel", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 149.55, "end": 154.91, "text": "Macchiato in your right hand and an iPhone 10 in your left.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 154.91, "end": 157.95, "text": "You need to start thinking Folgers and flip phones, bro.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 157.95, "end": 164.63, "text": "You can't start marriage with a wife and unlimited data.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 164.63, "end": 169.52, "text": "You got to pick one.", "avg_logprob": -0.1723, "no_speech_prob": 0.0773, "compression_ratio": 1.6779}
{"start": 169.52, "end": 174.02, "text": "When you haven't gotten marriage started right until you get your parent's hand-me-down", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 174.02, "end": 175.02, "text": "mattress.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 175.02, "end": 177.49, "text": "Can I get an amen on that one?", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 177.49, "end": 181.53, "text": "You know what I'm talking about, the dip already built in.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 181.53, "end": 182.53, "text": "You get in and you roll.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 182.53, "end": 185.41, "text": "Now that's a good way to start marriage.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 185.41, "end": 188.71, "text": "I tell the young guys at our church all the time, don't go to Ethan Allen.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 188.71, "end": 191.53, "text": "You can't afford Ethan Allen furniture.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 191.53, "end": 197.65, "text": "Go to Home Depot, buy cinder blocks and one-by-twelves for your shelving.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 197.65, "end": 198.65, "text": "You go to thrift stores.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 198.65, "end": 200.43, "text": "This is the only way to do it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1367, "no_speech_prob": 0.007, "compression_ratio": 1.6328}
{"start": 200.43, "end": 204.95, "text": "So we got married, we married young, we're celebrating now 23 years of marriage this", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 204.95, "end": 205.95, "text": "year.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 205.95, "end": 212.05, "text": "So I can't wait to be able to stand at 25 years and this is my daughter Corinne.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 212.05, "end": 213.19, "text": "She travels with me a lot.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 213.19, "end": 214.43, "text": "She's our pioneer girl.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 214.43, "end": 215.71, "text": "She's our outdoor girl.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 215.71, "end": 219.67, "text": "She loves knitting and crocheting and sewing and all of that.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 219.67, "end": 224.11, "text": "And this, Joe White raised this fawn and Corinne was like, man, I want to go see Sugar, want", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 224.11, "end": 225.51, "text": "to go see Sugar, want to go see Sugar.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 225.51, "end": 229.99, "text": "So I would take her down to see Sugar every chance I had.", "avg_logprob": -0.1715, "no_speech_prob": 0.0049, "compression_ratio": 1.8444}
{"start": 229.99, "end": 244.12, "text": "my son he loves deer too he's pretty passionate about deer. I did 78 events", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 244.12, "end": 248.92, "text": "last year around the country and two churches told me I could not show that", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 248.92, "end": 253.52, "text": "picture and so I didn't realize like oh I come from Branson Missouri you know", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 253.52, "end": 257.0, "text": "Bass Pro Shops country so I didn't realize that there's people sensitive to", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 257.0, "end": 260.92, "text": "this so so I've been asking everywhere I go hey is it okay if I show that picture", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 260.92, "end": 263.88, "text": "I came here like can I show that they're like are you kidding that's half the", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 263.88, "end": 271.65, "text": "profile pictures of the people who will be here tonight. So whenever I show that", "avg_logprob": -0.1311, "no_speech_prob": 0.0854, "compression_ratio": 1.8261}
{"start": 271.65, "end": 275.45, "text": "picture now in California or New York I make sure they know I release the deer", "avg_logprob": -0.158, "no_speech_prob": 0.1323, "compression_ratio": 1.587}
{"start": 275.45, "end": 283.38, "text": "in a forest preserve down the road. I never would take the life of an animal.", "avg_logprob": -0.158, "no_speech_prob": 0.1323, "compression_ratio": 1.587}
{"start": 283.38, "end": 292.82, "text": "No, I've never been hunting. I grew up in a fishing family and my dad taught", "avg_logprob": -0.158, "no_speech_prob": 0.1323, "compression_ratio": 1.587}
{"start": 292.82, "end": 297.46, "text": "us how to fish and so Joe White from Canicuck, he takes Carson out and teaches", "avg_logprob": -0.158, "no_speech_prob": 0.1323, "compression_ratio": 1.587}
{"start": 297.46, "end": 300.78, "text": "him for a year how to shoot and then he goes on Thanksgiving weekend he puts us", "avg_logprob": -0.158, "no_speech_prob": 0.1323, "compression_ratio": 1.587}
{"start": 300.78, "end": 305.82, "text": "in a blind, and by herself, just me and Carson, this 11,", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 305.82, "end": 308.7, "text": "12-point buck comes out within two hours.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 308.7, "end": 310.82, "text": "And any hunters in the room, can I just see?", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 310.82, "end": 311.66, "text": "I know I'm in Colorado.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 311.66, "end": 313.5, "text": "Yeah, so you know that.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 313.5, "end": 314.62, "text": "First time I ever experienced that.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 314.62, "end": 316.7, "text": "I felt it a little bit when I caught fish, but first time,", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 316.7, "end": 319.02, "text": "I was like, man, I started shaking like the adrenaline", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 319.02, "end": 319.74, "text": "was coursing through me.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 319.74, "end": 321.46, "text": "And I leaned over to Carson, and I go, I don't think I", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 321.46, "end": 325.2, "text": "should pick the gun.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 325.2, "end": 326.32, "text": "He said, Dad, I got it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 326.32, "end": 328.0, "text": "And he dropped that buck.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 328.0, "end": 329.16, "text": "And I was like, I couldn't believe it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 329.16, "end": 330.74, "text": "I didn't ask him to pose for that picture.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 330.74, "end": 331.96, "text": "We went down Creekside, man.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 331.96, "end": 333.04, "text": "We were high-fiving.", "avg_logprob": -0.1802, "no_speech_prob": 0.134, "compression_ratio": 1.6865}
{"start": 333.04, "end": 335.04, "text": "We were having the time of our lives.", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 335.04, "end": 336.8, "text": "And after about five minutes of celebrating,", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 336.8, "end": 338.96, "text": "Carson goes, Dad, Dad, Dad, what do we do?", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 338.96, "end": 339.9, "text": "What do we do?", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 339.9, "end": 347.76, "text": "I'm like, absolutely no idea.", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 347.76, "end": 355.02, "text": "But I think, according to the movie Red Dawn,", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 355.02, "end": 365.47, "text": "you've got to take a bite out of its heart", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 365.47, "end": 367.15, "text": "while I yell, Wolverines!", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 367.15, "end": 370.6, "text": "I think that's how this whole thing goes down.", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 370.6, "end": 373.32, "text": "I love raising kids.", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 373.32, "end": 376.08, "text": "I grew up in an independent, fundamental, pre-millennial,", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 376.08, "end": 378.48, "text": "King James version, only Baptist church.", "avg_logprob": -0.1677, "no_speech_prob": 0.0118, "compression_ratio": 1.586}
{"start": 378.48, "end": 382.92, "text": "And so I grew up in a church that taught me how to love Jesus, grew up in a home that", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 382.92, "end": 386.98, "text": "taught me how to love Jesus, but I grew up in a church and a home that taught me how", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 386.98, "end": 391.06, "text": "to honor purity, not necessarily marriage.", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 391.06, "end": 394.1, "text": "And I really wasn't all that prepared for marriage.", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 394.1, "end": 397.3, "text": "I wasn't prepared, I wasn't discipled in this area.", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 397.3, "end": 402.88, "text": "I mean the message I got on Hebrews 13, 4 growing up, the Hebrews 13, 4 says, marriage", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 402.88, "end": 406.38, "text": "should be honored by all and the marriage bed kept pure.", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 406.38, "end": 408.34, "text": "And this is how it was taught to us.", "avg_logprob": -0.1346, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 2.0244}
{"start": 408.34, "end": 410.76, "text": "Sex is dirty, nasty, and ugly,", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 410.76, "end": 420.14, "text": "and you should save it for the one you love.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 420.14, "end": 422.14, "text": "Raise your hand if you learned that growing up.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 422.14, "end": 423.8, "text": "Would you just raise your hand?", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 423.8, "end": 426.34, "text": "It's because we grew up in churches and homes", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 426.34, "end": 427.26, "text": "that taught us well,", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 427.26, "end": 429.82, "text": "but we never talked about this subject.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 429.82, "end": 430.9, "text": "It was never discussed.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 430.9, "end": 433.7, "text": "I wasn't prepared for it going into marriage.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 433.7, "end": 436.1, "text": "I wasn't, I remember on the day of my wedding", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 436.1, "end": 439.78, "text": "is when my dad decided, I should have that talk with him.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 439.78, "end": 441.02, "text": "Now, this would be a good time.", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 441.02, "end": 445.41, "text": "We're walking through the parking lot of La Quinta,", "avg_logprob": -0.1104, "no_speech_prob": 0.0223, "compression_ratio": 1.6828}
{"start": 445.41, "end": 451.5, "text": "And we know what La Quinta means, it means next to Denny's.", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 451.5, "end": 453.38, "text": "We're walking over to Denny's and my dad,", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 453.38, "end": 455.98, "text": "my 52-year-old engineer father,", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 455.98, "end": 459.21, "text": "says, son, do you have any questions?", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 459.21, "end": 462.41, "text": "I said, dad, it's a little too late.", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 462.41, "end": 465.01, "text": "I don't, I can't, I'm not gonna share anything.", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 465.01, "end": 466.01, "text": "And I think that's the answer he wanted.", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 466.01, "end": 469.63, "text": "He goes, I just want you to know I'm available", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 469.63, "end": 471.63, "text": "if you have any questions.", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 471.63, "end": 472.95, "text": "And I said, no, and I'll never forget,", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 472.95, "end": 477.47, "text": "I went into marriage with that bad belief on my heart.", "avg_logprob": -0.1412, "no_speech_prob": 0.0077, "compression_ratio": 1.6373}
{"start": 477.47, "end": 481.07, "text": "Feeling like a pervert when I would initiate with my wife.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 481.07, "end": 484.79, "text": "I'll never forget one night in bed, she was reading a book.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 484.79, "end": 486.95, "text": "About seven years into our marriage,", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 486.95, "end": 489.19, "text": "she was reading a book on how men think.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 489.19, "end": 490.55, "text": "It's not a real thick book.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 490.55, "end": 503.95, "text": "You can read it in about a night, that's true.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 503.95, "end": 505.23, "text": "I always get asked, what book are you talking,", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 505.23, "end": 507.51, "text": "it's Shanti Feldhein's book, Four Women Only,", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 507.51, "end": 511.05, "text": "talking about how men are turned on visually.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 511.05, "end": 513.99, "text": "And my wife is reading this book, and I mean,", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 513.99, "end": 515.83, "text": "she's getting more and more mad.", "avg_logprob": -0.1594, "no_speech_prob": 0.0407, "compression_ratio": 1.759}
{"start": 515.83, "end": 518.11, "text": "She's frustrated with this book.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 518.11, "end": 520.27, "text": "And I'm over here in the fetal position", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 520.27, "end": 524.44, "text": "on this side of the bed, not wanting to talk about it,", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 524.44, "end": 525.98, "text": "not wanting to have a conversation.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 525.98, "end": 527.36, "text": "Because I grew up in a church and a home.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 527.36, "end": 528.64, "text": "We didn't talk about it.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 528.64, "end": 531.28, "text": "Why start talking about it now?", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 531.28, "end": 535.2, "text": "And Amy, my wife, said, we're talking about it.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 535.2, "end": 536.46, "text": "And we had a conversation.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 536.46, "end": 539.38, "text": "That week, she dove into everything she could find,", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 539.38, "end": 542.94, "text": "everything that Beth Moore ever said on the subject.", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 542.94, "end": 544.48, "text": "See, I mentioned Beth Moore tonight,", "avg_logprob": -0.132, "no_speech_prob": 0.0026, "compression_ratio": 1.7675}
{"start": 544.48, "end": 548.14, "text": "and there's ladies going, who, what, what?", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 548.14, "end": 551.02, "text": "I gotta know what she say, what'd she say?", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 551.02, "end": 553.74, "text": "We know if Beth Moore said it, Jesus believes it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 553.74, "end": 561.06, "text": "That's really how that whole thing comes down.", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 561.06, "end": 562.54, "text": "She came to me at the end of the week", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 562.54, "end": 565.18, "text": "and she said, listen, we gotta have a conversation.", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 565.18, "end": 567.3, "text": "We gotta be able to talk openly about this", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 567.3, "end": 570.22, "text": "and not be embarrassed by the subject,", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 570.22, "end": 572.38, "text": "not let it be full of shame or guilt", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 572.38, "end": 575.54, "text": "as maybe some of you were raised to think of this subject.", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 575.54, "end": 577.53, "text": "She said, we need to be open about it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 577.53, "end": 579.93, "text": "I said, okay, let's have the conversation.", "avg_logprob": -0.1266, "no_speech_prob": 0.0017, "compression_ratio": 1.75}
{"start": 579.93, "end": 581.73, "text": "And we started having the conversation", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 581.73, "end": 587.24, "text": "and we realized this should have taken place way earlier.", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 587.4, "end": 589.36, "text": "We realized a lot of couples don't ever talk about,", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 589.36, "end": 591.4, "text": "a lot of couples have that same bad belief in their heart", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 591.4, "end": 592.24, "text": "they never talk about.", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 592.24, "end": 594.76, "text": "So we created a menu at our church,", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 594.76, "end": 597.4, "text": "52 questions to give the married couples", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 597.4, "end": 600.0, "text": "that they could begin asking one another these questions", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 600.0, "end": 602.6, "text": "to find out what's in the heart of one another", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 602.6, "end": 604.88, "text": "when it comes to sexual intimacy", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 604.88, "end": 607.16, "text": "and keeping the marriage bed pure.", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 607.16, "end": 610.16, "text": "And we taught one Sunday on the Song of Solomon", "avg_logprob": -0.114, "no_speech_prob": 0.0004, "compression_ratio": 1.7952}
{"start": 610.16, "end": 612.28, "text": "And when they left, I said, hey, listen,", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 612.28, "end": 613.76, "text": "as you leave here today, I want you", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 613.76, "end": 618.02, "text": "to pick up this 52-question menu and a two-hour burning candle.", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 618.02, "end": 620.92, "text": "And I want you to go home, light the candle,", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 620.92, "end": 625.0, "text": "and have a two-hour conversation about intimacy.", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 625.0, "end": 628.16, "text": "And the next week, one Ozarkian Bubba came up to me", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 628.16, "end": 629.98, "text": "and he said, hey, pastor, yeah, I", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 629.98, "end": 632.2, "text": "found out you light that candle under a ceiling fan.", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 632.2, "end": 640.44, "text": "It only takes about 45 minutes.", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 640.44, "end": 643.28, "text": "Well, that was not the point.", "avg_logprob": -0.1217, "no_speech_prob": 0.0155, "compression_ratio": 1.6731}
{"start": 643.28, "end": 647.68, "text": "We wanted them to slow down and have a conversation.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 647.68, "end": 650.12, "text": "And I want to get you started on that conversation tonight.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 650.12, "end": 654.36, "text": "This is called Love, Laugh, and what's the last one?", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 654.36, "end": 656.36, "text": "Pursue.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 656.36, "end": 660.36, "text": "The Hebrew term for pursue is bam, bam, chicka, chicka, bam,", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 660.36, "end": 667.56, "text": "bam.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 667.56, "end": 674.45, "text": "The Beth Moore ladies all are like, I made that up.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 674.45, "end": 675.86, "text": "That's not true.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 675.86, "end": 677.3, "text": "But I like to start with the guys.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 677.3, "end": 678.98, "text": "And I just want this to be helpful.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 678.98, "end": 680.74, "text": "We want this to be a helpful night for you.", "avg_logprob": -0.1903, "no_speech_prob": 0.0025, "compression_ratio": 1.6988}
{"start": 680.74, "end": 683.5, "text": "how to pursue your wife romantically", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 683.5, "end": 685.62, "text": "and how to prepare her for a night of romance.", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 685.62, "end": 688.3, "text": "You know what I hear a lot in the counseling office?", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 688.3, "end": 691.16, "text": "I hear a lot of guys say,", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 691.16, "end": 696.45, "text": "I spent an entire day thinking tonight was the night,", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 696.45, "end": 700.77, "text": "only to discover it wasn't even on her radar.", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 700.77, "end": 703.33, "text": "So here's how you can begin to prepare your wife.", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 703.33, "end": 705.85, "text": "This isn't about manipulation, this isn't about control.", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 705.85, "end": 708.09, "text": "It's about having a conversation", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 708.09, "end": 712.29, "text": "and enjoying and keeping the marriage bed pure,", "avg_logprob": -0.0817, "no_speech_prob": 0.0065, "compression_ratio": 1.7045}
{"start": 712.29, "end": 714.37, "text": "Honoring marriage, esteeming it is highly valuable.", "avg_logprob": -0.1926, "no_speech_prob": 0.0261, "compression_ratio": 1.2667}
{"start": 714.37, "end": 717.61, "text": "So guys, number one, it starts early in the morning.", "avg_logprob": -0.1926, "no_speech_prob": 0.0261, "compression_ratio": 1.2667}
{"start": 717.61, "end": 720.05, "text": "Okay, when it comes to sex, men are microwaves.", "avg_logprob": -0.1926, "no_speech_prob": 0.0261, "compression_ratio": 1.2667}
